{
  "name": "current-work-running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "afterMs": 0,
      "event": {
        "kind": "request",
        "text": "帯の「作業中」を確かめたい（架空の依頼）",
        "images": []
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 100,
      "event": {
        "kind": "speech",
        "text": "長く走る手順を1つやってみるね。",
        "expression": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 200,
      "event": {
        "kind": "tool-started",
        "toolUseId": "fake-tool-current-work-running-1",
        "name": "Bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "dummy-long-wait --seconds 20",
          "description": "架空の長い実行"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 20000,
      "event": {
        "kind": "tool-finished",
        "toolUseId": "fake-tool-current-work-running-1",
        "content": "ダミーの実行結果（架空・20秒後）",
        "isError": false
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 20100,
      "event": {
        "kind": "utterance",
        "text": "## 帯の「作業中」を確かめる場面\n\nこれは架空の本文で、実物の会話ではない。**自分の `request` を持つ**ので `TSUKUMO_FAKE_SCENE` で直接起こしてもターンが進行中のまま長く続き、帯の「いまの作業」に「作業中」と実行中の手順が出る（`scripts/capture/capture-catalog.ts` の `current-work-running`）。\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "afterMs": 20200,
      "event": {
        "kind": "turn-finished",
        "outcome": {
          "kind": "completed"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
